# Only ship sources, licenses and the SYNTCOMP scripts. CMakeLists.txt also
# defines test targets, so their C++ sources must be present at configure time.
*
!CMakeLists.txt
!LICENSE
!src
!libs
!test
test/*
!test/aigcheck.cpp
!test/statesearch.cpp
!scripts

# Submodules can contain local build products; compile afresh in the container.
**/.git
**/build*
**/CMakeFiles
**/CMakeCache.txt
**/*.o
**/*.a
**/*.so
**/*.dylib
**/*.exe
